The state 5GMM-DEREGISTERED is entered in the UE, when:
a) the de-registration is performed either by the UE or by the network (see clause 5.5.2);
b) the registration request is rejected by the AMF (see clause 5.5.1.2.5 and 5.5.1.3.5);
c) the service request is rejected by the AMF (see clause 5.6.1);
d) the UE is switched on; or
e) the UE registered for emergency services is in 5GMM-IDLE mode and its periodic registration update timer expires (see clause 5.3.7).
In state 5GMM-DEREGISTERED, the UE shall behave according to the substate as explained in clause 5.2.2.3.

